---
import { requestChecks } from '../../data/content';
---

<figure class="border border-rule rounded-sm bg-raised p-5 sm:p-6">
	<figcaption class="eyebrow">Request path: Application / Agent → Prism Gateway → Providers &amp; MCP Tools</figcaption>
	<div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-2.5 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto_minmax(0,2.5fr)_auto_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:items-stretch">
		<div class="border border-rule rounded-sm p-4 flex flex-col justify-center bg-paper/50 min-w-0">
			<span class="font-mono text-xs text-muted">01 · CALLER</span>
			<span class="font-medium mt-1">Application or Agent</span>
			<span class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">OpenAI SDK, n8n, LangGraph, or HTTP MCP client</span>
			<span class="mt-2 font-mono text-xs text-muted flex flex-wrap gap-x-2 gap-y-0.5">
				<span>Bearer prism_sk_YOUR_KEY</span>
				<span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
				<span>X-Prism-Agent-ID</span>
			</span>
		</div>

		<div class="flex items-center justify-center text-muted font-mono text-sm py-0.5 lg:px-1" aria-hidden="true">
			<span class="lg:hidden">↓</span>
			<span class="hidden lg:inline">→</span>
		</div>

		<div class="border-2 border-accent rounded-sm p-4 bg-paper/30 min-w-0">
			<span class="font-mono text-xs text-accent">02 · PRISM GATEWAY CHECKS (IN ORDER)</span>
			<ol class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
				{requestChecks.map((c) => (
					<li class="border-t border-rule pt-2.5 min-w-0">
						<span class="block font-medium text-sm leading-snug">{c.name}</span>
						<span class="block text-sm text-muted leading-snug mt-1">{c.detail}</span>
					</li>
				))}
			</ol>
		</div>

		<div class="flex items-center justify-center text-muted font-mono text-sm py-0.5 lg:px-1" aria-hidden="true">
			<span class="lg:hidden">↓</span>
			<span class="hidden lg:inline">→</span>
		</div>

		<div class="border border-rule rounded-sm p-4 flex flex-col justify-center bg-paper/50 min-w-0">
			<span class="font-mono text-xs text-muted">03 · UPSTREAM</span>
			<span class="font-medium mt-1">Providers &amp; MCP Tools</span>
			<span class="text-sm text-muted mt-1">Upstream secrets stay inside Prism; calls and denials are logged</span>
			<code class="mt-2 font-mono text-xs text-muted break-all">Models · MCP · Tools</code>
		</div>
	</div>
</figure>
